# Command Center

Shared config UI for top-bar layout, presets/roles, and look settings. Data stored in `edminboost_settings['command_center']`.

## Class: `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center`

- `get_defaults()` / `get_settings()` — merged CC settings
- `get_page_links()` / `get_nav_items()` — CC sub-nav links (Dashboard, Layout Presets, Appearance, Menu Studio, Top Bar, Productivity, Security, Performance, White Label, Settings)
- `resolve_top_bar_items_for_user( $cc_settings )` — applies `role_assignments` preset layouts at runtime before `role_visibility` filtering
- `get_menu_studio_defaults()` — default `menu_studio` shape
- `is_setup_complete()` — whether top bar is configured
- `get_look_skins()`, `apply_look_skin()`, `detect_look_skin()` — look-only behavior bundles (stored in `look_skin`; legacy/API helpers, not shown on Dashboard UI)
- `get_preset_categories()`, `get_virtual_layout_presets()`, `get_picker_presets( $include_virtual )` — preset library grouping + virtual `default` / `custom` entries for pickers
- `detect_active_layout_preset()`, `resolve_effective_preset_id()`, `top_bar_items_match()` — match saved top bar to picker selection
- `get_preset_layout_definitions()`, `resolve_preset_top_bar_items()`, `apply_preset()` — layout presets
- `get_personas()`, `get_system_presets()`, `get_all_presets()` — preset catalog
- `get_discovered_menu_items()` — scans global `$menu` for Top Bar editor
- `get_assignable_roles()`, `get_badge_sources()`, `get_dashicon_options()` — UI option lists
- `get_animation_speed_options()`, `get_animation_duration_ms( $speed = '' )` — drawer transition speeds (`fast` 150ms, `normal` 300ms, `slow` 500ms)
- Drawer width constants: `DRAWER_CUSTOM_WIDTH_MIN` (400), `DRAWER_CUSTOM_WIDTH_MAX` (800), `DRAWER_CUSTOM_WIDTH_DEFAULT` (600)

Page slug suffixes: `PAGE_ONBOARDING` (`-onboarding`, legacy redirect), `PAGE_MAPPER` (`-mapper`), `PAGE_PRESETS` (`-presets`), `PAGE_BEHAVIOR` (`-behavior`, legacy redirect), `PAGE_APPEARANCE` (`-appearance`), `PAGE_MENU_STUDIO` (`-menu`), `PAGE_PRODUCTIVITY` (`-productivity`), `PAGE_SECURITY` (`-security`), `PAGE_PERFORMANCE` (`-performance`), `PAGE_WHITE_LABEL` (`-white-label`).

## Live Admin Bar: `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center_Bar`

Not a feature module — registered directly in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`.

- `normalize_item_slug( $slug )` — public wrapper for `resolve_admin_slug()`; normalizes relative paths and full admin URLs (used in top-bar sanitization).
- `register_nodes()` on `admin_bar_menu` (priority 80) — adds nodes from saved `top_bar_items` for the current user.
- `apply_declutter()` on `admin_bar_menu` (priority 999) — removes `wp-logo`, `comments`, `my-account`, `updates`, `new-content`, `customize` per `behavior` toggles.
- `maybe_prepare_drawer_frame()` on `admin_init` — when `edminboost_drawer=1`, verifies nonce, whitelists slug+anchor via `is_drawer_slug_allowed()` (or mapper preview via `edminboost_mapper_preview=1`), then prints iframe chrome-stripping CSS on `admin_head`.
- `ajax_drawer_preview()` on `wp_ajax_edminboost_cc_drawer_preview` — Layout Studio only; capability + `check_ajax_referer( 'edminboost_cc_drawer_preview' )` + `is_mapper_preview_context()`; returns signed `frameUrl` / `openUrl` JSON.
- `is_mapper_screen()` — current admin page is Layout Studio. `is_mapper_preview_context()` — mapper screen **or** AJAX referer contains mapper slug (admin-ajax has no `$_GET['page']`).
- `enqueue_assets()` on `admin_enqueue_scripts` and `wp_enqueue_scripts` — loads bar CSS when `is_active()` or `is_mapper_screen()`; loads bar JS + `edminboostCcBar` when `has_drawer_items()` or mapper screen.
- `render_drawer_shell()` on `admin_footer` and `wp_footer` — outputs `#edminboost-cc-drawer` when plugin enabled, user logged in, and (`has_drawer_items()` or `is_mapper_screen()`).
- `is_active()` — plugin enabled, user logged in, admin bar showing, and `get_items_for_current_user()` non-empty.
- `has_drawer_items()` — any current-user item with `interaction === drawer`.
- `get_items_for_current_user()` — filters items by `role_visibility` (hidden slugs per role).
- Node IDs: `edminboost-cc-{md5(slug + "\0" + anchor)}`; meta class `edminboost-cc-bar-item`; drawer triggers add `edminboost-cc-bar-drawer-trigger` and use `href="#"`.
- Badge markup: `edminboost-cc-bar-badge edminboost-cc-bar-badge--{style}`.
- URLs: `get_item_url( $slug, $anchor )` — `admin_url( $slug )` + optional `#anchor`; full `http(s)` URLs pass through `esc_url()` with optional fragment.

### Slide-out drawer

- Drawer shell: `#edminboost-cc-drawer` with BEM classes `edminboost-cc-drawer__*`; width from behavior (`panel--compact|standard|fullscreen|custom`); `custom` uses inline `--edminboost-cc-drawer-width` (px); optional `is-glass` for glassmorphism; duration via CSS var `--edminboost-cc-drawer-duration`.
- Shell pre-renders one `<iframe class="edminboost-cc-drawer__iframe">` per drawer item (`loading="eager"`, `data-edminboost-frame-url`); JS reuses/caches frames and prefetches on admin-bar hover.
- Drawer iframe chrome: `filter_drawer_frame_body_class` adds `edminboost-cc-drawer-frame`; `dequeue_drawer_frame_assets` strips heartbeat, auth-check, and admin-bar assets inside the iframe.
- JS (`edminboost-command-center-bar.js`) opens drawer on admin-bar click, loads signed iframe URL, supports backdrop/close/Escape; `body.edminboost-cc-drawer-active` locks scroll. Exposes `window.edminboostCcOpenDrawer( item )` for Layout Studio preview.
- Iframe URL: `get_drawer_frame_url( $slug, $anchor, $mapper_preview )` adds `edminboost_drawer=1`, `edminboost_slug`, optional `edminboost_anchor`, `_wpnonce` (action `edminboost_cc_drawer_{md5(slug + "\0" + anchor)}`); mapper preview adds `edminboost_mapper_preview=1`.
- Layout Studio preview: mapper JS POSTs to `admin-ajax.php` (`edminboost_cc_drawer_preview`); `edminboostData.drawerPreview` localized only on mapper screen.
- Localized `edminboostCcBar.drawerItems` maps node IDs to `{ slug, label, frameUrl, openUrl }`.

## Rendering

- Dashboard: `render_admin_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-admin-page.php` — first-run setup wizard (`edminboost-setup-wizard.php`) when `! is_setup_complete()`, else post-setup overview (`edminboost-dashboard-overview.php` with inline layout/theme pickers + preview partials); CC sub-nav shown only after setup is complete
- Settings: `render_settings_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-settings-page.php` (CC sub-nav; global kill switch + JSON export/import only)
- Productivity: `render_productivity_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-productivity-page.php` (feature fields via `edminboost-feature-fields.php`, `$section = productivity`)
- Security: `render_security_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-security-page.php` (`$section = security`)
- Performance: `render_performance_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-performance-page.php` (`$section = performance`)
- White Label: `render_white_label_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-white-label-page.php`
- Appearance: `render_appearance_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-appearance-page.php` (visual theme, panel/badges, admin bar declutter)
- Top Bar: `render_mapper_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-mapper-page.php`
- Layout Presets: `render_presets_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-presets-page.php`
- Menu Studio: `render_menu_studio_page()` → `admin/partials/edminboost-menu-studio-page.php`
- Theme UI: partial `admin/partials/edminboost-theme-settings.php` (included on Appearance + setup wizard step 2)
- Legacy `-onboarding` redirects to Dashboard; legacy `-behavior` redirects to Appearance
- CC partials use `.edminboost-wrap.edminboost-cc-wrap` (add `.edminboost-cc-wrap--wide` for mapper/presets)

## Settings API Forms

CC pages submit via `options.php` with `settings_fields( EDMINBOOST_Settings::SETTINGS_GROUP )`. Field names:

```
edminboost_settings[command_center][look_skin]
edminboost_settings[command_center][_apply_preset]          # apply layout preset
edminboost_settings[command_center][_setup_wizard_save]    # marker: 1 when setup wizard submits (sets onboarding_completed)
edminboost_settings[command_center][_apply_look_skin]       # apply look skin
edminboost_settings[command_center][_keep_advanced_behavior] # save advanced look without skin reset
edminboost_settings[command_center][_layout_studio_save]     # marker: 1 when Top Bar form submits
edminboost_settings[command_center][top_bar_items][0][slug|anchor|label|icon|interaction|badge_source]
edminboost_settings[command_center][role_assignments][role_key]
edminboost_settings[command_center][behavior][drawer_width|drawer_width_custom|animation_speed|...]
edminboost_settings[command_center][theme][preset|mode|font|font_size|admin_favicon_id|admin_bg_color|schedule_dark_mode|custom_accent|custom_surface|custom_text|custom_top|custom_sidebar|status_*]
edminboost_settings[command_center][_menu_studio_save]                              # marker: 1 when Menu Studio form submits
edminboost_settings[command_center][menu_studio][enabled|order|submenu_order|hidden_items|custom_items|use_colors|colors|menu_width|font_size|icon_display|text_display|padding]
edminboost_settings[white_label][enabled|hide_wp_footer_credit|show_*|login_*|admin_logo_*|plugin_*|menu_label|lock_white_label]
```

CC + settings forms use class `.edminboost-cc-form` or `.edminboost-settings-form`; JS intercepts submit and POSTs to `wp_ajax_edminboost_save_settings` (nonce from `settings_fields()`).

Sanitization: `EDMINBOOST_Settings::sanitize_command_center()` (private) — whitelist personas, presets, icons, interactions, badge sources, behavior enums.

Layout Studio save: when `_layout_studio_save` is present, `top_bar_items` is always sanitized — an empty array clears the stored layout (fix for removing all items). Other CC pages omit this field so they do not overwrite `top_bar_items`.

Menu Studio save: when `_menu_studio_save` is present, `menu_studio` is always sanitized from the submitted payload.

Allowed values:

| Key | Values |
|-----|--------|
| `persona` | `client`, `ecommerce`, `developer` (empty = none) |
| `interaction` | `redirect`, `drawer` |
| `drawer_width` | `compact`, `standard`, `fullscreen`, `custom` |
| `drawer_width_custom` | integer px, clamped 400–800 (default 600) |
| `animation_speed` | `fast`, `normal`, `slow` |
| `badge_style` | `dot`, `pill`, `accent` |
| `badge_source` | `''`, `wc_orders`, `wc_reviews`, `comments`, `updates`, `forms_entries` |
| `autosave_interval` / `badge_refresh_rate` | integers, clamped 10–600 / 15–600 |

## Top Bar Item Shape

```php
array(
	'slug'         => 'edit.php',
	'anchor'       => '',         // optional URL fragment (no leading #)
	'label'        => 'Posts',
	'icon'         => 'dashicons-admin-post',
	'interaction'  => 'redirect', // or 'drawer'
	'badge_source' => '',         // key from get_badge_sources()
)
```

Slug uniqueness is per `slug + anchor` pair. Sanitizer splits `#` from slug when anchor is empty; anchor pattern `^[a-zA-Z0-9_\-\.]+$`.

